  unitName: Solid Frame Dolgrag
  unitId: 40745
  unitNumber: 1317
  description: As Dolgrag acquired even more knowledge from its disciple mentor,
    it began upgrading its functions and abilities as well. Amidst it all, rumors
    claiming that the master it had sworn to protect had been betrayed and executed
    by the Holy Emperor reached its ears. This piece of news led its mentor to go
    after the Holy Emperor in order to assert the true state of their master, something
    Dolgrag intended to stop by chasing after her. Unfortunately, when they both
    arrived to their destination they realized that the rumors about their master's
    death had been true. Dolgrag also realized shortly after that they had been lured
    there as part of a trap.
  summonDesc: No details found on my manufacturing process. Systems indicate probability
    of otherworldly techniques being used in my production.
  fusionDesc: Powerful presence confirmed.<br>Functions upgraded.<br>Lie detection
    ability installed...
  evoDesc: Linguistics functions upgraded.<br>This is all thanks to you.<br>I will
    prove myself useful.
